     4| * Wraps individual screen sections (Reels, Members, Projects, Deals) so a
     5| * crash in one module shows a retry button for that section instead of
     6| * crashing the entire application.
     7| *
     8| * Error categories: AUTH_ERROR, NETWORK_ERROR, DATA_ERROR, RENDER_ERROR,
